                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Time Boxing Per Topic</h3>
                    <p>Allocate specific minutes to each agenda item. When the timer is visible, people self-regulate. You don't have to be the bad guy interrupting - the clock does it for you.</p>
                </div>

